config XXRI_KERNEL
	bool
	prompt "xxri-kernel: Tiny Core 16.0 kernel 6.12.11 (pinned binary)"
	help
	  The unmodified Tiny Core 16.0 vmlinuz, fetched from the Tiny Core
	  16.0 release archive and checked against its sha256.  XXRI keeps the
